# Phase 3 baselines: model + image cache (never commit; ~16MB Kraken model,
# image cache grows with folio coverage). KRAKEN_PIN.md tracks the pinned
# sha256; re-fetch via baselines/scripts/fetch_biblia_kraken_model.py.
baselines/.cache/
# Phase 03.2 baselines: UXLC source cache (fetched from tanach.us via
# gt_infra.uxlc_import.fetch_uxlc.fetch_uxlc_book). Reproducible — re-fetch
# at any time. Keeps the repo lean while preserving deterministic provenance
# (each gt_adapter golden's _provenance block records the source).
baselines/tests/fixtures/_uxlc_cache/

# Regen artifacts from scripts/regenerate_*.py.
# Source-of-truth numbers live in the paper repo, not here; regenerating
# locally is for operator/CI verification, not commit.
paper_iaa_results.json
nakdimon_tier2_baseline.json

# Baseline output trees. Withdrawn from v0.1 (Option A defers baselines to
# v0.1.1); a local `python -m baselines.run` recreates them, along with the
# line-crop JPEGs and .in_progress/ sandbox. Nothing here is published until
# v0.1.1 re-opens promotion, at which point the promoted artifacts are added
# explicitly. tests/test_manifest_hash_artifacts.py asserts this stays empty.
results/
results_provisional/

